    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25238" root="صوك" body-key="S">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَاكَ بِهِ</span></b> , (O, K,) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَصُوكُ</span>, (O,) inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَوْكٌ</span>, (K,) <i>It stuck,</i> or <i>clave, to him,</i> or <i>it:</i> (O,
K;) said of saffron, (K,) and of blood, and of
other things: (TA:) and (O, K) so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صاك به</span>, aor.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَصِيكُ</span>, (S, O, K, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صيك</span>,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيْكٌ</span>; (K;)
said of perfume. (S, O, K.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَئِكَ</span>.

